From bcca85b9083512bccdb039a1770834ee6e246646 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jared Wen <jaredwen@inferact.ai>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 05:27:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 25/25] fix: align GLM strict tool schema order

Build GLM strict-mode structural tags from deep copies carrying the same
required-first property order rendered into the prompt. This keeps the
xgrammar key order aligned with what the model sees while leaving the
request untouched.

Upstream: https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/55558
Upstream-Commit: bcca85b9083512bccdb039a1770834ee6e246646
